      "ldac:age": "57",
      "gender": "Female",
      "description": "Piotr Dubois-Ngata belongs to Accidental Constructivism and works in a borrowed greenhouse. Asked about influences, Piotr Dubois-Ngata said only \"listening to grey\". Primary Occupation: Conceptual artist; the best work is the absence of work.",
